cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CLAUDIU (working codename): tabbed browser interface for Claude Code sessions"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-08-30
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: Campolim
    given-names: Fabio
abstract: >
  A local, browser-based tabbed interface for running several Claude Code
  CLI sessions at once. A small Python server spawns real `claude`
  processes in pseudo-terminals and streams them into browser tabs via
  xterm.js, adding tabs, an eye-friendly theme, adjustable fonts, prompt
  snippets, and a project launcher on top of full terminal fidelity.
keywords:
  - claude-code
  - terminal
  - xterm.js
  - tornado
  - developer-tools
